      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "810000\n\\(S=30=2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5\\). The divisors of \\(S\\) are \\(1,2,3,5,6,10,15,30\\). Each prime factor appears 4 times, so the product is \\(2^{4} 3^{4} 5^{4}=30^{4}=810000\\).",
